# k.geo/shards/psys2-city-words: 15 other spellings of cities we have, from the names PSys2 used (Saint Petersburg for St. Petersburg, Sevilla for Seville): a city of PSys2 within 5 km of ours whose name is spelt alike.
# sources: geonames all-the-cities-3.1.0 (GeoNames, CC-BY-4.0, https://www.geonames.org), as carried by the PSys2 world geo.map
# sources: psys2-worlds 6b63b2ba (the selection)
# license: CC-BY-4.0
# script: tools/import/psys2.mjs

